<title>JAPAN: Tasaki Shinju sets terms for No.4 CB.</title>
<headline>Tasaki Shinju sets terms for No.4 CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Tasaki Shinju Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sumitomo Bank</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO 4	  AMT   12 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	  MATURITY 31.Oct.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 1.Sept.97  CONV TO 1.Sep.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 23.Jul.97  INT PAY end-Apr/Oct</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 16-22 Jul</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on July 15.</p>
